{"steam_appid":3004140,"steam_name":"LockYourDoor","trailer_hls":"https://video.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_trailers/3004140/1504280394/6a2eda752874926addeab26214d35f44bc55d588/1754494728/hls_264_master.m3u8?t=1754497224","trailer_thumb":"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/257179186/1adecf801b50f755257a2c5ec1922f0a4d4ecfd6/movie_600x337.jpg?t=1754497224","screenshots":["https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3004140/a4abfb93a9b7540c924a1d76513e689a60159f80/ss_a4abfb93a9b7540c924a1d76513e689a60159f80.1920x1080.jpg?t=1766769744","https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3004140/9446953fbb5af7e21202342348d32dffff76b251/ss_9446953fbb5af7e21202342348d32dffff76b251.1920x1080.jpg?t=1766769744","https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3004140/9d51f21a02d1d8ad126947ffaea6f6b49094b363/ss_9d51f21a02d1d8ad126947ffaea6f6b49094b363.1920x1080.jpg?t=1766769744","https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3004140/81e3700b7be4a2f5d36a354f6c47964d54495781/ss_81e3700b7be4a2f5d36a354f6c47964d54495781.1920x1080.jpg?t=1766769744","https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3004140/0866924be1f72a2d4b062b548fd730dd7c8bd115/ss_0866924be1f72a2d4b062b548fd730dd7c8bd115.1920x1080.jpg?t=1766769744"],"about_the_game":"<h2 class=\"bb_tag\" ><strong>LockYourDoor</strong></h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >LockYourDoor is a Survival Horror game for 1-4 players. Your aim is to survive while you search for your friend Darvin.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" > </p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" style=\"text-align: center\"><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3004140/extras/f51a510b6cb672c26d391162f5bf1f56.poster.avif?t=1766769744\" width=614 height=324 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3004140/extras/f51a510b6cb672c26d391162f5bf1f56.webm?t=1766769744\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3004140/extras/f51a510b6cb672c26d391162f5bf1f56.mp4?t=1766769744\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3004140/extras/8bf789a1253e4040a7105e4076b095af.avif?t=1766769744\" data-big-src=https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3004140/extras_big/8bf789a1253e4040a7105e4076b095af.avif?t=1766769744 width=800 height=60 /></span></p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" ><strong>About The Game</strong></h2><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>1-4 player online Co-op</strong><br>As a group of up to 4 survivors, you will explore your surroundings and confront various threats. Uncover the truth and make strategies together. Support one another to stay alive. (Or you can choose to betray. You don't need to die, your friends can die instead!)</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Challenging gameplay</strong><br>As time passes, more threats will emerge, and your small amount of light will fade even faster. Follow Darvin's guidance to adapt to new situations. Be smart and plan your next move carefully.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p></li></ul><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" style=\"text-align: center\"><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><picture><source srcset=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3004140/extras/d1b2d86920804f8daf685ff37a637b19.webp?t=1766769744\"><img src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3004140/extras/d1b2d86920804f8daf685ff37a637b19.poster.webp?t=1766769744\" class=\"bb_img\" width=614 height=234 /></picture></span><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3004140/extras/8bf789a1253e4040a7105e4076b095af.avif?t=1766769744\" data-big-src=https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3004140/extras_big/8bf789a1253e4040a7105e4076b095af.avif?t=1766769744 width=800 height=60 /></span></p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" ><strong>Key Features</strong></h2><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Locking Your Door</strong></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Each player will find keys for different rooms. Those keys can be used to lock-unlock certain doors for certain purposes. When night falls, players must be prepared to face the terrifying nightmares lurking in the dark.</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Different Monsters, Each With Unique Specializations.</strong></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >LockYourDoor features various AIs, each with its own features, strengths and weaknesses.</p></li></ul><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" style=\"text-align: center\"><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><picture><source srcset=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3004140/extras/943f6ca1c91a48b4d8f459f9dc1a79a5.webp?t=1766769744\"><img src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3004140/extras/943f6ca1c91a48b4d8f459f9dc1a79a5.poster.webp?t=1766769744\" class=\"bb_img\" width=614 height=234 /></picture></span><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3004140/extras/8bf789a1253e4040a7105e4076b095af.avif?t=1766769744\" data-big-src=https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3004140/extras_big/8bf789a1253e4040a7105e4076b095af.avif?t=1766769744 width=800 height=60 /></span></p><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Darvin's Notes And The Journal</strong></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Follow your friend Darvin's guidance to survive and search for his clues along the way.</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Items and Variety</strong><br>LockYourDoor offers a variety of items, each with unique purposes. The more you play, the more you'll uncover their uses and learn to utilize them effectively. Item and key spawns are highly randomized, ensuring no two games ever feel the same.</p></li></ul><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Long and pleasing gameplay</strong></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p></li></ul><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" style=\"text-align: center\"><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3004140/extras/81970b213549c7744d6a10a1ba14acdc.poster.avif?t=1766769744\" width=610 height=230 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3004140/extras/81970b213549c7744d6a10a1ba14acdc.webm?t=1766769744\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3004140/extras/81970b213549c7744d6a10a1ba14acdc.mp4?t=1766769744\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3004140/extras/8bf789a1253e4040a7105e4076b095af.avif?t=1766769744\" data-big-src=https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3004140/extras_big/8bf789a1253e4040a7105e4076b095af.avif?t=1766769744 width=800 height=60 /></span></p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" ><strong>WARNING</strong></h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" > </p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" > According to the developers, this game may contain content that is not suitable for all ages or for viewing in a professional environment: Violence, gore, and general mature themes.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p>","requirements_minimum":"<strong>Minimum:</strong><br><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><strong>OS:</strong> Windows 10<br></li><li><strong>Processor:</strong> Intel Core i5-8400 / Ryzen 5 1600<br></li><li><strong>Memory:</strong> 8 GB RAM<br></li><li><strong>Graphics:</strong> NVIDIA GTX 1050 (4GB VRAM)<br></li><li><strong>DirectX:</strong> Version 11<br></li><li><strong>Network:</strong> Broadband Internet connection<br></li><li><strong>Storage:</strong> 3 GB available space</li></ul>","requirements_recommended":"<strong>Recommended:</strong><br><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><strong>OS:</strong> Windows 11<br></li><li><strong>Processor:</strong> Intel Core i5-10400F / Ryzen 5 3600X<br></li><li><strong>Memory:</strong> 16 GB RAM<br></li><li><strong>Graphics:</strong> NVIDIA RTX 2060 (6GB VRAM)<br></li><li><strong>DirectX:</strong> Version 12<br></li><li><strong>Network:</strong> Broadband Internet connection<br></li><li><strong>Storage:</strong> 3 GB available space</li></ul>","genres":["Action","Adventure"],"developers":["Penguin's Autumn"],"publishers":["Penguin's Autumn"],"release_date":"17 Nov, 2025"}